{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05161","headline":"奉酬燕公见归田赋垂赠之作 · 赵冬曦","name":"奉酬燕公见归田赋垂赠之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穷鸟婴笼缀，孤飞任播迁。\n鹪鹩王佐用，复此挫冲天。\n楚云何掩郁，湘水亦回邅。\n怀哉愧木鴈，忽尔枉兰荃。\n愈疾同枚叔，销忧比仲宣。\n归途书可畏，弱操石犹坚。\n覆载虽云广，涔阳直块然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}